; Willy's air state: on the ground, jumping, falling or killed
;
; 0: standing or walking on ground, or holding a rope (#R$85D6)
; .
; 1: in a jump; #R$85D5 counts the steps 0-17 (the arc is described at #R$8DD3)
; .
; 2-$0F: falling. 2 when he walks off an edge or bumps his head, 6 at the end of a jump; it counts up by
; 1 in every pass of the fall and from $10 returns to $0C, so a long fall cycles through $0C-$0F. A
; landing with a state of $0C or more kills him (#R$8EE3). Standing at the take-off point that
; means a drop of 5 character rows (40 pixel rows) or more; after a jump that ended over a gap
; (state 6) a drop of 3 rows or more. Drops of 4 and 2 rows respectively are survived.
; .
; $FF: killed (set by #R$90B7, see WILLY_KILLED); the frame loop then plays the death flash (#R$8B17)
; and either restarts the room from #R$85D7 or ends the game.
; .
; Set to 0 at a new game and by the exit up (#R$94B0); exit down (#R$94D2) makes it 2 when it was
; below $0B. Saved at room entry in #R$85D7.
; .
; Observed: falls from each height checked in the Bathroom with Willy poked into the air, see
; findings F92-F94.
@label=WillyAirState
g$85D1 DEFB $00
